+`layout.mode` controls how story content and the map share the StoryMap viewport. `card`
+(default) keeps the floating-card presentation and supports left/center/right alignment plus
+optional width/height ratios. `full` keeps the map full-bleed and places the story surface
+on the left or right with a configurable content ratio and progressive transparent fade.
